import ../../../testing/driver.dl
import lib/text_scan.dl

appearance form appearance:
    maximum width is 480
    padding is 16
    gap is 12
    columns are 2
    when viewport is below 400:
        columns are 1

appearance field appearance:
    font size is 18
    padding is 10
    minimum height is 44
    background is UI ink 245 247 249
    text is UI ink 22 28 36
    border width is 1
    border is UI ink 170 180 190
    corner radius is 6

document form using form appearance:
    text field "Name" containing "Ada\n" using field appearance
    switch "Auto save" using field appearance
    choice field "Mode" choosing "Fast" using field appearance:
        choice "Fast"
        choice "Calm"
    paragraph "After" containing "After the form" using no UI appearance
    read only text field "Public token" containing "public" using field appearance

set instance to an instance of form
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 600 by 500 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set field to the UI layout labeled "Name" in (view's layout)
set toggle to the UI layout labeled "Auto save" in (view's layout)
set choice to the UI layout labeled "Mode" in (view's layout)
require condition (field's lines != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text line)) reporting "A document text field has no text layout."
require condition ((field's content = "Ada") and (field's typeface's size = 18)) reporting "A document field ignored its content or authored font."
set drawn to (view's window as a pointer to test UI surface)'s drawn
require condition (((drawn contains "Ada") and (drawn contains "Auto save")) and (drawn contains "Fast")) reporting "A document form did not paint its controls."
require condition (((field's bounds' height >= 44.0) and (toggle's bounds' height >= 44.0)) and (choice's bounds' height > 0.0)) reporting "Document form controls did not reserve their natural height."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's text focus = field's node) and (view's input context's active)) reporting "Tab did not activate a document field's shared input bridge."
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing " Lovelace" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (field's node) in window)'s text = "Ada Lovelace") reporting "A document field did not use shared text editing."
require condition ((field's typeface's size = 18) and (field's appearance's padding = 10.0)) reporting "Editing a field discarded its authored appearance."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (field's node) in window)'s text = "Ada") reporting "A document field lost shared undo."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (field's node) in window)'s text = "Ada") reporting "Enter inserted a newline into a single-line field."
require condition (view's focused = toggle) reporting "A document field trapped Tab instead of entering the next control."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 32 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the value of "Auto save" in window) = 1) reporting "A document switch did not share keyboard activation."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's popup = choice) reporting "A document choice field did not open its shared popup."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 264 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (((the UI value for (choice's node) in window)'s text = "Calm") and (view's popup = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout))) reporting "A document choice field did not share popup selection."
set view's width to 300
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (toggle's bounds' y > field's bounds' y) reporting "Document form controls did not stack at their responsive threshold."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set the text of "Name" in window to "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 269 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (field's text scroll > 0.0) reporting "A document field did not scroll horizontally to its caret."
require condition ((view's input context's active) and (view's input context's font's size = 18)) reporting "The document field's input bridge ignored its authored font."
set left to field's painted bounds' x + field's appearance's padding
set right to (((field's painted bounds' x + field's bounds' width) - field's appearance's padding) + 2.0)
require condition ((view's input context's bounds' x >= left) and (view's input context's bounds' x <= right)) reporting "The input bridge caret escaped the scrolled field."
set the text of "Name" in window to "Grace\nHopper\t"
require condition ((the UI value for (field's node) in window)'s text = "GraceHopper") reporting "Programmatic field text ignored the single-line input policy."
set public to the UI layout labeled "Public token" in (view's layout)
activate UI layout public in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 65 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "changed" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 67 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's window as a pointer to test UI surface)'s copied = "public") reporting "A styled read-only field did not retain selection and copying."
require condition (((the UI value for (public's node) in window)'s text = "public") and (view's input context's active = false)) reporting "A styled read-only field accepted editing or activated text input."
close the address of view
close window
print line "Responsive form controls share field editing, switch activation, choice selection, authored styles and caret scrolling."
